    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i pulled the pan and there's definitely some clutch material and fine metal shavings in there. it feels almost like something is actively interfering with the flow every time the gear shifts. is there anything else that could cause that kind of sudden, unpredictable behavior in the hydraulics besides just debris?",
